&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Included is a pre-supported Chitubox file that includes the Bullshark and Hammerhead for resin printing that has been tested and adjusted. Test printing was done on an Elegoo Mars in Elegoo Standard Gray at 7.7s / layer. I suggest running it through the Photon File Validator before printing!
